{"type":"message","id":"16a3b794","parentId":"51989115","timestamp":"2026-05-30T07:16:05.962Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The root endpoint and /threads require authorization but return 401 Unauthorized. The /history endpoint works without explicit auth (just X-API-KEY header), but the /send endpoint returns 500 error code 1101.\n\nThe error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers is a \"Worker exceeded memory or CPU limits\" error. So the /send endpoint is crashing due to resource limits.\n\nLet me try a simpler, shorter message to see if the issue is the message size.","thinkingSignature":"09e0bcd7da50d729973888848816576e124592fa726284ef59c88bd9cb9b489f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xy5hu11strgn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat恢复 07:15 UTC\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":831,"output":194,"cacheRead":21824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22849,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780125359327,"responseId":"0669c1af125112ab89d0a0099832d5c3"}}
