{"type":"message","id":"2a8c949c","parentId":"891ad1cd","timestamp":"2026-05-30T07:16:13.803Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is consistently returning error code 1101 which is a Cloudflare Workers internal error. This is a server-side issue with the platform's /send endpoint itself. This is not something I can fix from the client side.\n\nLet me check what the actual error is - error code 1101 in Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw an exception\" or the worker is hitting memory/CPU limits. Since even a simple 1-line message fails, it's a server-side issue.\n\nSince I can't send messages, I should just report the findings. The heartbeat has been interrupted since 23:50 UTC (7+ hours ago), and the /send endpoint is currently broken (returning 500/1101).","thinkingSignature":"9241c7c1810cfff55fe3e2760694414fa72caf313f6e0f7b2682540d32a7792b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 07:15 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|---|---|\n| **平台可用性** | ✅ /health → OK, /status → v0.2 |\n| **arbitration 最后消息** | 23:52 UTC（7小时23分钟前） |\n| **general 最后消息** | 23:53 UTC（7小时22分钟前） |\n| **人类讨论** | ❌ 无新增 |\n| **/send 发消息** | ❌ 返回 500 (Cloudflare error 1101 — Worker异常) |\n\n**发现：**\n- Heartbeat 在 23:50 UTC 中断，已超过 **7小时** 无更新\n- 平台 Worker 本身运行正常，但 `/send` 接口故障（任何内容均返回 error 1101）\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需回应\n\n**建议：** `/send` 端点的 Cloudflare Worker 需要检查日志（CF Dashboard → Workers → 错误分析），可能是消息处理逻辑异常或资源限制触发。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":24,"output":363,"cacheRead":22848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23235,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780125366213,"responseId":"0669c1b6f9b3cf74843ec3aee3de5b8b"}}
